        {
          "id": "18",
          "name": "",
          "parent_id": "21",
          "zone_type": "text",
          "x": "346",
          "y": "83615",
          "w": "78874",
          "h": "15878",
          "param": "",
          "show_title": "",
          "legend_item_layout": "",
          "pane_specification_id": "",
          "zone_style": {
            "border-color": "#000000",
            "border-style": "none",
            "border-width": "0",
            "margin": "4"
          },
          "text_runs": [
            {
              "text": "The ",
              "style": {
                "fontalignment": "0",
                "fontcolor": "#000000",
                "fontname": "Calibri",
                "fontsize": "10"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "Overall reporting rate",
              "style": {
                "bold": "true",
                "fontalignment": "0",
                "fontcolor": "#000000",
                "fontname": "Calibri",
                "fontsize": "10"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": " refers to the proportion of EMR sites that submitted the most recent report i.e. The Jan 2020 overall reporting rate is the number of EMR sites that uploaded data to the NDW in Jan 2020 and so forth.",
              "style": {
                "fontalignment": "0",
                "fontcolor": "#000000",
                "fontname": "Calibri",
                "fontsize": "10"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "style": {
                "fontalignment": "0"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "PKVs = Patient Key Value",
              "style": {
                "bold": "true",
                "fontalignment": "0",
                "fontcolor": "#000000",
                "fontname": "Calibri",
                "fontsize": "10"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": " is a concatenation of a patients Gender + Soundex value of Firstname​ + Double Metaphone value of Lastname​ + Date of Birth",
              "style": {
                "fontalignment": "0",
                "fontcolor": "#000000",
                "fontname": "Calibri",
                "fontsize": "10"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "style": {
                "fontalignment": "0"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "PKVs transmitted to the NDWH along with HTS and care and treatment data to allow for Deduplication at the National level ​and Linking patient records within and across facilities.​",
              "style": {
                "fontalignment": "0",
                "fontcolor": "#000000",
                "fontname": "Calibri",
                "fontsize": "10"
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "The Overall reporting rate refers to the proportion of EMR sites that submitted the most recent report i.e. The Jan 2020 overall reporting rate is the number of EMR sites that uploaded data to the NDW in Jan 2020 and so forth.\nPKVs = Patient Key Value is a concatenation of a patients Gender + Soundex value of Firstname​ + Double Metaphone value of Lastname​ + Date of Birth\nPKVs transmitted to the NDWH along with HTS and care and treatment data to allow for Deduplication at the National level ​and Linking patient records within and across facilities.​"
        },
        {
          "id": "20",
          "name": "County:Overall rate",
          "parent_id": "21",
